---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { JERSEY_SIZES } from '../lib/utils.js';
---

<Layout title="Paket & Benefit Peserta — BAZNAS Fun Walk 2026" activePage="paket">
  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="sec sec--dark page-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker">Official Race Pack & Benefit</p>
      <h1>Paket Peserta BAZNAS Fun Walk 2026</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Dapatkan perlengkapan jalan sehat berkualitas premium berstandar event lari nasional untuk kenyamanan dan kebanggaan Anda saat melangkah di Soreang.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Visual Hero Benefit -->
  <section class="sec">
    <div class="wrap grid-2">
      <div class="benefit-img-container">
        <img 
          src="/assets/racepack-benefit.webp" 
          alt="Jersey, Tote Bag, dan Wristband Resmi BAZNAS Fun Walk 2026"
          class="benefit-main-img"
          loading="eager"
          width="2200"
          height="1555"
        />
        <div class="benefit-badge">Official Merchandising 2026</div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="kicker">Perlengkapan Resmi</p>
        <h2>Setiap Peserta Mendapatkan Perlengkapan Lengkap</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          Semua peserta terdaftar (baik Paket Reguler maupun Charity Pack) berhak menerima paket race pack resmi yang diserahkan saat Race Pack Collection (RPC) tanggal 19–20 November 2026.
        </p>

        <div class="items-list">
          <div class="item-card">
            <span class="item-icon">
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.38 3.46L16 2a4 4 0 0 1-8 0L3.62 3.46a2 2 0 0 0-1.34 2.23l.58 3.47a1 1 0 0 0 .99.84H6v10a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h8a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V10h2.15a1 1 0 0 0 .99-.84l.58-3.47a2 2 0 0 0-1.34-2.23z"></path></svg>
            </span>
            <div>
              <h4>Jersey Eksklusif BAZNAS Fun Walk</h4>
              <p>Menggunakan bahan Microfiber Drifit premium yang sejuk, menyerap keringat dengan cepat, elastis, dan nyaman dipakai berjalan 5 kilometer. Tersedia ukuran Anak dan Dewasa.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="item-card">
            <span class="item-icon">
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 2L3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z"></path><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"></line><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"></path></svg>
            </span>
            <div>
              <h4>Official Goodie Bag</h4>
              <p>Goodie bag ramah lingkungan dengan logo resmi BAZNAS, memuat aneka suvenir dan perlengkapan peserta.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="item-card">
            <span class="item-icon">
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 7v5l3 3"></path></svg>
            </span>
            <div>
              <h4>Gelang Resmi (Silicone Wristband)</h4>
              <p>Gelang identitas peserta tahan air dengan nomor pengenal untuk akses masuk area panggung utama dan penukaran refreshment.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="item-card">
            <span class="item-icon">
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="6" width="20" height="12" rx="3"></rect><path d="M6 12h.01M18 12h.01"></path><path d="M2 10h20"></path></svg>
            </span>
            <div>
              <h4>Official Wristbag Eksklusif</h4>
              <p>Tas pergelangan/wristbag praktis dan trendy untuk menyimpan smartphone, kunci, dan kartu saat beraktivitas jalan sehat 5K.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="item-card">
            <span class="item-icon">
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path></svg>
            </span>
            <div>
              <h4>Nomor BIB & Kupon Doorprize Utama</h4>
              <p>Nomor kepesertaan unik yang terhubung dengan sistem undian doorprize berhadiah utama Paket Umroh dan puluhan hadiah menarik lainnya.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Comparison Section -->
  <section class="sec sec--tint">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div style="text-align:center; max-width:700px; margin:0 auto 48px">
        <p class="kicker">Perbandingan Kategori</p>
        <h2>Pilih Paket yang Sesuai untuk Anda</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin:0 auto">
          Tersedia paket perseorangan (Regular Pack) dan keluarga (Family Pack). Termasuk donasi ZIS yang disalurkan langsung melalui BAZNAS Kabupaten Bandung.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="table-responsive card-clean" style="padding:0; overflow:hidden">
        <table class="compare-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th style="width:44%">Benefit & Fasilitas</th>
              <th style="width:28%" class="col-reguler">
                <div class="th-title">Regular Pack</div>
                <div class="th-price">
                  <del style="opacity:0.6; font-size:0.85rem; text-decoration:line-through; margin-right:4px">Rp 120.000</del>
                  <b>Rp 80.000</b> <small>(Early Bird)</small>
                </div>
                <small style="color:var(--leaf); font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:700">Promo 1–14 Okt (Kuota 500)</small>
              </th>
              <th style="width:28%" class="col-family">
                <div class="th-title">Family Pack</div>
                <div class="th-price"><b>Rp 200.000</b> <small>(2 Orang)</small></div>
                <small style="color:var(--leaf); font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:700">(Untuk 2 Orang) Termasuk Rp 20.000 Donasi</small>
              </th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Jersey Drifit Resmi BAZNAS Fun Walk</td>
              <td class="check-yes">✓ 1 Pcs</td>
              <td class="check-yes">✓ 2 Pcs</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Gelang Resmi (Silicone Wristband)</td>
              <td class="check-yes">✓ 1 Pcs</td>
              <td class="check-yes">✓ 2 Pcs</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Goodie Bag</td>
              <td class="check-yes">✓ 1 Pcs</td>
              <td class="check-yes">✓ 2 Pcs</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Official Wristbag BAZNAS Fun Walk</td>
              <td class="check-yes">✓ 1 Pcs</td>
              <td class="check-yes">✓ 2 Pcs</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Nomor Peserta & Kupon Doorprize Umroh</td>
              <td class="check-yes">✓ 1 Kupon Undian</td>
              <td class="check-yes">✓ 2 Kupon Undian</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Refreshment Air Mineral</td>
              <td class="check-yes">✓ Termasuk (1 Orang)</td>
              <td class="check-yes">✓ Termasuk (2 Orang)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Pos Medis & Pengawalan Jalur 5K Steril</td>
              <td class="check-yes">✓ Termasuk</td>
              <td class="check-yes">✓ Termasuk</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="row-highlight">
              <td>
                <b>Alokasi Donasi ZIS Terhitung</b>
                <div class="hint">Disalurkan untuk program kemanusiaan & mustahik BAZNAS</div>
              </td>
              <td>
                <div><b>Rp 0 (Early Bird)</b></div>
                <small style="opacity:0.75">Normal: Rp 20.000</small>
              </td>
              <td class="check-yes"><b>✓ Rp 20.000 (Untuk 2 Orang)</b></td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="row-highlight">
              <td>
                <b>Opsi Tambahan Infaq Sukarela</b>
                <div class="hint">Pilihan nominal 10k, 20k, 50k, 100k, atau nominal lainnya</div>
              </td>
              <td class="check-yes">✓ Tersedia</td>
              <td class="check-yes">✓ Tersedia</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Aksi Pendaftaran</td>
              <td><a href="/daftar?paket=reguler" class="btn btn-sun btn-sm" style="width:100%">Daftar Reguler</a></td>
              <td><a href="/daftar?paket=family" class="btn btn-leaf btn-sm" style="width:100%">Daftar Family</a></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Size Chart Section -->
  <section class="sec" id="size-chart">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div style="text-align:center; max-width:700px; margin:0 auto 40px">
        <p class="kicker">Panduan Ukuran</p>
        <h2>Size Chart Jersey Resmi (Anak & Dewasa)</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin:0 auto">
          Tersedia ukuran lengkap dari anak-anak hingga dewasa. Pastikan Anda memilih ukuran jersey yang pas saat pendaftaran.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="size-chart-grid">
        <div class="table-responsive card-clean" style="padding:0; overflow:hidden">
          <table class="size-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Kategori</th>
                <th>Ukuran</th>
                <th>Lebar Dada</th>
                <th>Panjang Badan</th>
                <th>Rekomendasi</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {JERSEY_SIZES.map(item => (
                <tr>
                  <td>
                    <span class={item.category === 'Anak' ? 'cat-pill cat-pill--child' : 'cat-pill cat-pill--adult'}>
                      {item.category}
                    </span>
                  </td>
                  <td><b class="size-tag">{item.size}</b></td>
                  <td>{item.chest}</td>
                  <td>{item.length}</td>
                  <td>{item.desc}</td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <div class="card-clean fit-tips">
          <h4>Tips Memilih Ukuran:</h4>
          <ul class="tips-list">
            <li><b>Ukuran Anak:</b> Didesain proporsional untuk rentang usia 4 hingga 12 tahun.</li>
            <li><b>Bahan Drifit:</b> Bersifat lentur, sejuk, dan elastis. Jika Anda menyukai pakaian pas badan, pilih ukuran biasa.</li>
            <li><b>Suka Longgar / Hijab:</b> Untuk kenyamanan berhijab atau gaya pakaian longgar, kami sarankan naik 1 ukuran (misal dari M ke L).</li>
            <li><b>Toleransi Jahitan:</b> Toleransi standar konveksi adalah ±1 sampai 2 cm.</li>
          </ul>
          <div style="margin-top:24px">
            <a href="/daftar" class="btn btn-leaf" style="width:100%">Lanjut ke Formulir Pendaftaran →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    padding: clamp(50px, 6vw, 80px) 0;
  }

  .benefit-img-container {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .benefit-main-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .benefit-badge {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 16px;
    left: 16px;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--lime);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .items-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .item-card {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    background: var(--paper-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--r-md);
    padding: 16px;
  }

  .item-icon {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .item-card h4 {
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .item-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--grey);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Compare Table */
  .table-responsive {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .compare-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .compare-table th, .compare-table td {
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .compare-table thead th {
    background: var(--paper-2);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .col-donasi {
    background: #F8FBF8;
  }

  .col-reguler {
    background: #FFFDF5;
  }

  .col-family {
    background: #F2F9F2;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--leaf);
  }

  .cat-pill {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .cat-pill--child {
    background: #EBF5FF;
    color: #1E40AF;
  }

  .cat-pill--adult {
    background: var(--paper-2);
    color: var(--ink);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .th-title {
    font-family: 'Baloo 2', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .th-price {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--leaf);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .th-price small {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--grey);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .check-yes {
    color: var(--leaf);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .check-no {
    color: var(--grey-light);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .row-highlight {
    background: rgba(31, 137, 57, 0.05);
  }

  /* Size chart */
  .size-chart-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .size-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .size-table th, .size-table td {
    padding: 14px 18px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .size-table th {
    background: var(--paper-2);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .size-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--lime);
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .fit-tips {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .tips-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  .tips-list li {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--grey-d);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .size-chart-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
